    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome.\n",
        "This is Team Galactic Headqu...\r",
        "I’m sorry, this is the Galactic\n",
        "Veilstone Building.\r",
        "We have no public events planned\n",
        "at this time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Galactic conducts R&D around\n",
        "the clock here.\r",
        "We focus on the development of new\n",
        "energy resources."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "This is where we, Team Galactic, work.\n",
        "What are we supposed to do?\r",
        "I’m not sure how, but we’re supposed\n",
        "to chase our dream.\r",
        "Our dream of making a wonderful\n",
        "new world!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "We, Team Galactic, will take everything\n",
        "that can be taken!\r",
        "We will eliminate everything that is\n",
        "not needed!\r",
        "That is Team Galactic’s policy!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "We, Team Galactic, will take everything\n",
        "that can be taken!\r",
        "We will eliminate everything that is\n",
        "not needed!\r",
        "That is Team Galactic’s policy!\r",
        "At least it used to be.\n",
        "There’s nothing left now..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re too young for us...\n",
        "You can join us when you’re older."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00007",
      "en_US": "I wonder where our boss went..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Saturn: So, it’s you...\r",
        "I’ve heard about you and what took\n",
        "place at the Spear Pillar.\r",
        "What our boss really wanted...\n",
        "Even I don’t know that.\r",
        "His confident manner of speaking...\n",
        "His logical words...\r",
        "I think people just became so\n",
        "enthralled by him.\r",
        "I allowed myself to believe his words\n",
        "because I wanted to see the world\\fhe intended to make.\r",
        "I’ve been left in charge of this\n",
        "HQ building and the remnants of\\fthe membership...\r",
        "The decision on what Team Galactic\n",
        "should do rests with me...\r",
        "But I’ve learned that extremism\n",
        "is never the solution..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "The door is locked.\n",
        "A special key is needed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "The door is locked.\n",
        "A special key is needed.\r",
        "Use the Galactic Key?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00011",
      "en_US": "The door opened."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1068_D26R0101_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "The Team Galactic credo!\n",
        "Everything belongs to Team Galactic!\r",
        "Look beyond the world--space will\n",
        "become Team Galactic’s!"
      ]
    }
  ]
